                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>Do referral programs actually work for D2C?</h3>
                                        <p>For right categories + right mechanics: yes. 5-15% of new customer acquisition at 40-60% lower CAC than paid. Requires strong product + design discipline.</p>
                                        <h3>What is the biggest referral program mistake?</h3>
                                        <p>Discount-driven not brand-driven. Weak product experience doesn't drive advocacy regardless of incentive size.</p>
                                        <h3>Should incentives be double-sided?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes — referrer + friend both need meaningful incentive. Single-sided referrals underperform meaningfully.</p>
                                        <h3>Is WhatsApp referral effective in India / UAE?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes — WhatsApp-native one-tap sharing dramatically outperforms form-based referrals in India + UAE + Southeast Asia.</p>
